{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0294_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "a7633e852b0158b14565b57febeff831c7fa00106e6eb97d2a4df9b34b110b7a", "ja": "あっ、もちろん私は、風の戦士ですけど……！\nでも長い旅の中、強敵とまみえることもありますよね？", "zh": "啊，当然啦，我是风之战士……！\n不过在漫长的旅途中，也会遇到强敌，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
