{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0294_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "ac043a85ade997bfee1c3a9b28fcbcbac2ae448ab8dc1a04e22caa4e4c5f49c7", "ja": "ひとつの精霊の守護しか得られないはずが、\n風と水、ふたつの力を使いこなす……！", "zh": "本应只能得到一个精灵的守护，却能将风与水这两种力量运用自如……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
